ext":"バウンド・ケーキは、小麦、砂糖、バターが1 pound (453.5g) づづという極悪さ。","ts":"1626357660.459500","thread_ts":"1626356834.458100","edited":{"user":"U013QL1RAPN","ts":"1626357747.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"yabai","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XGSWZ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"fa9fc521-7bbd-4e24-b35b-382577569936","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ポテトサラダやケーキは、作った事がある人であればヤバさが分かる。","ts":"1626356834.458100","thread_ts":"1626356834.458100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nLhH"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"be8e13d2-b369-4fd3-b9af-439ab5aeeec4","type":"message","user":"U78UYGX8W","text":"独り身なのに18cmホールケーキ作ってむしゃむしゃ食べてた時代が一番やばかったなぁ","ts":"1626357322.459200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":2,"users":["UFHQ7TNT0","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gvpc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e64cfc23-0be6-4985-83ca-0c17f749536b","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"クッキーもね","ts":"1626357275.458600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=wVs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fa9fc521-7bbd-4e24-b35b-382577569936","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ポテトサラダやケーキは、作った事がある人であればヤバさが分かる。","ts":"1626356834.458100","thread_ts":"1626356834.458100","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS","UL6CFN8NR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nLhH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A964C278-E2E9-414E-8C81-969E6C34CA5F","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"\u0026gt; ジョエル・ロブションはかつてじゃがいもの量の40%（現在は25%まで減らしたようです）を推奨し「50%まで増やせばもっとリッチに。さらにはじゃがいもの同量まで増やすこともできる」と言っています。\n\u003chttps://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/nbfebcf7c4129|https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/nbfebcf7c4129\u003e","ts":"1626356069.457400","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: 究極のマッシュポテトのレシピ｜樋口直哉(TravelingFoodLab.)｜note","id":1,"title":"究極のマッシュポテトのレシピ｜樋口直哉(TravelingFoodLab.)｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/nbfebcf7c4129","text":"シンプルなマッシュポテトは人気のあるメニュー。肉料理だけではなく、魚料理などにも使える万能のつけ合わせです。今日は『究極のマッシュポテト』の作り方。 究極のマッシュポテトとはどんなものでしょうか？　世界一のマッシュポテトといえばまず偉大なシェフ、ジョエル・ロブションの『じゃがいものピュレ』が挙げられます。彼は「自分が三ツ星を穫れたのはじゃがいものピュレとグリーンサラダのおかげ」と語っていますが、ロブションはじゃがいもというありふれた食材を究極の美味に変えました。 究極のマッシュポテト 　じゃがいも(ほくほくしたもの) 300g\u0026amp;nbsp; 　牛乳(低脂肪でないもの) 100","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/5306160/rectangle_large_a763e7c118ed10030fc7907a4931a984.jpg?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/nbfebcf7c4129","original_url":"https://note.com/travelingfoodlab/n/nbfebcf7c4129"}],"edited":{"user":"UFHQ7TNT0","ts":"1626356091.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xp8R"}]},{"client_msg_id":"77407DE9-3653-4068-99A0-0B2FE0FD9B4A","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"あー、でもそれだと糖質もはいっちゃうのか","ts":"1626356026.457200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wPjV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1C0589B8-E38D-4901-8B12-38F8A17AF1A9","type":"message","user":"U81LLJ340","text":"ドイツで食べたのもたしかにバターをふんだんに使ってそうな味だった(そして美味しかった)","ts":"1626356005.456600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"za18X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"DC18D548-D26E-4889-94E1-ADD7963632BC","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"そういえば、本物のマッシュポテトは脂質の塊ですよ。ジャガイモの半分の重さのバター入れます。","ts":"1626355919.455300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BfwlR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3fbab85e-9beb-4bd1-b8b8-e65371305629","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"最近色々調べてわかったことなんですが\nダイエット方法は大きく分けて２種類あります\n\n1. ケトジェニック\n2. ローファット\nケトジェニックは\n1. 高脂質\n2. 中タンパク質\n3. 低糖質\nローファットは\n1. 高タンパク質\n2. 中炭水化物\n3. 低脂質\nというPFCバランスになってい、どちらも絞れるそうです\n\nケトジェニックの場合は、体を脂質をエネルギー源とする体になるので、脂肪燃焼がしやすく落としやすい\nローファットの場合は、脂質を抑えるので消費カロリーも抑えられて痩せる\n\nという仕組みらしい","ts":"1626355900.454700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"K7e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e0da677d-0f63-489b-a312-7652b823094b","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"ポテサラはヤバそうですね\n糖質と脂質の固まりのイメージ","ts":"1626355304.450200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HrOH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1238a49c-48fc-4ae2-ae00-9cf1e8ee1129","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"芋にマヨネーズってヤバさしかない","ts":"1626355078.449600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bti"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b46e7efc-33f7-4140-91f3-7c5d2a8636de","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"危険","ts":"1626355048.449400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"kiken","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2Jc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2227f3fb-f34a-4a50-b4a6-26f2ab07594b","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"ポテサラは脂質も多そう","ts":"1626355036.449300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l1iq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"325c042f-da2d-488c-9bfd-ff41a97e4185","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"以前業務スーパーのポテトサラダをガバガバ食ってたけどだいぶやばかったんだな","ts":"1626354861.449100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_origi